    <div class="hero-grid">
      <h1>The factory, the shop, <i>and the line between them.</i></h1>
      <p class="lede">India audits its registered factories to the last rupee and met the rest of its enterprises only in 2021. This dossier puts the two counts on one page — side by side, never as one line.</p>
